  "description": "O Donnellan and Joyce are delighted to offer for sale a two bed second floor apartment, situated in the heart of Salthill Village, Galway.\n\r\nGlenview House is a privately owned & well managed apartment complex. \r\n\nThe area is highly sought after & considered one of Galway's most popular residential locations.\n\nApartment 4 Glenview House is perfectly positioned smack bang in the heart of Salthill village, opposite the Salthill Church.  \r\n\r\nThe location offers a huge range of amenities & services within the Salthill area with a variety of shops, schools and a fantastic range of restaurants & cafes.\r\n\r\nGalway City, UCHG and The University of Galway are all easily accessible on foot or by the regular bus route that runs by the property every 20 minutes.\r\n\r\nNo 4 Glenview House is presented in turnkey condition and ready for immediate occupancy with two balconies. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is comprised of an open plan kitchen/living area, a bathroom and two bedrooms, one double and one single.  \r\n\r\nThe property also contains two balconies, one to the front of the property off one of the bedrooms provides views over Salthill Village and a second private rear facing balcony off the lounge room.\r\n\r\nA 20 minute walk from the vibrant cobbled streets of Galway city with the famed Spanish Arch and Galway’s Latin Quarter offering a host of top-class restaurants.\r\n\r\nThere are also several sports & leisure facilities within walking distance such as the Galway Bay Golf Club, the Galway Lawn Tennis Club, the local GAA grounds at Pearse Stadium.\r\n\r\nDue to its central location, Glenview House appeals not only to investors but owner occupiers and use as holiday homes.\r\n\nNo. 4 Glenview House is a gilt-edge investment opportunity, with a strong rental yield.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database.\n\nFor Further details please contact O’Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer.  They are for information only and give a general idea of the property.  They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only.  The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout.  All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy.  Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.",
